                  </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"556\" data-height=\"887\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_556/h_887/202/63428/2023/6/8/678859.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_556/h_887/202/63428/2023/6/8/678859.png\"></div><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"组队思路\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"狐狸难点分析\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn active\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1.自身800点反射，</span>让没有续航的队伍生存压力很大，且没有狂暴的情况下，刀打FT会暴毙。（没有吸血附魔的下场）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2.自身加速，</span>一旦加速层数叠高，反射几乎无缝，且DS涨的很快</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">Drive超高伤害，</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">附带自身4秒无敌效果</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">（开出大招直接团灭，且浪费大量输出时间）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">整体看下来，难度算是最标准的星主Boss，比岛夫人和亚里亚略简单一些，这其中有很多因素：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">1.拉姆蕾萨尔的破防幅度极高，没有破防压力</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">2.水系有集中Buff，配合光系满充角色不会卡暴击</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">3.水系有百分比六连刀——艾芮儿</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">4.狐狸的技能组反制手段比较简单，用退DS条+清Buff+血咒即可无伤打Boss</span></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">应该说，狐狸就是纯粹的练度检测器，练度达标随便过。</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"角色替换思路\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"margin:1px1px0.13333rem;background:rgb(248,248,248);height:0.90667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);font-size:0.32rem;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><span class=\"text\" style=\"margin:0px0px0px0.8rem;color:rgb(75,82,91);width:auto;\"></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"常驻干扰\" style=\"width:4rem;background:rgb(255,255,255);height:0.64rem;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin:0px0px0px0.8rem;color:rgb(75,82,91);\">是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn active\" style=\"width:1.06667rem;height:0.53333rem;background:rgb(0,182,79);vertical-align:middle;\"></label></span><div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\" style=\"color:rgb(75,82,91);height:32px;\"><label style=\"\">目录颜色：</label><div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"width:0.53333rem;height:0.53333rem;background:rgb(102,102,102);\"></div></div><button class=\"del-catalog-btn\" style=\"background:rgb(0,182,79);color:rgb(255,255,255);width:1.06667rem;height:0.64rem;\">删除</button></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\">常驻干扰</div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605160233313_78519464.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);width:64px;height:64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605157796565_47141566.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);width:64px;height:64px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(64,64,64);\">两者都无可替代，其中</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(201,0,0);\">狼人至少点火3星</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(201,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161690734_9120736.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:64px;height:64px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(201,0,0);\">至少点火4星</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(64,64,64);\">，若不满足，</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(64,64,64);\">可用<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605160158572_77287904.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width:64px;height:64px;\">替代</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"margin:1px1px0.13333rem;background:rgb(248,248,248);height:0.90667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);font-size:0.32rem;\"><span class=\"text\" style=\"margin:0px0px0px0.8rem;color:rgb(75,82,91);width:auto;\"></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"破防组合\" style=\"width:4rem;background:rgb(255,255,255);height:0.64rem;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin:0px0px0px0.8rem;color:rgb(75,82,91);\">是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn active\" style=\"width:1.06667rem;height:0.53333rem;background:rgb(0,182,79);vertical-align:middle;\"></label></span><div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\" style=\"color:rgb(75,82,91);height:32px;\"><label style=\"\">目录颜色：</label><div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"width:0.53333rem;height:0.53333rem;background:rgb(102,102,102);\"></div></div><button class=\"del-catalog-btn\" style=\"background:rgb(0,182,79);color:rgb(255,255,255);width:1.06667rem;height:0.64rem;\">删除</button></div><br style=\"\"></span></div></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\">破防组合1</div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_248/h_246/202/63428/2022/11/16/464098.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"248\" data-height=\"246\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:64px;height:63px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640535917155_67069371.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:64px;height:64px;\"></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(64,64,64);\">拉姆+泽卡提</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(64,64,64);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,0);\">最完美的破防组合，</span>其中</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(201,0,0);\">拉姆至少点火6星</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(64,64,64);\">，泽卡提不需要点火。</span></div></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\">如果没有泽卡提，则使用<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1607677056839_7406485.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width:64px;height:64px;\">代替（</span><span style=\"color:rgb(201,0,0);\">至少点火3星</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\">，且负作用很大，尽量别用他）</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\">破防组合2</div></div></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605160178429_57391278.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold;width:64px;height:64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605158773314_52661384.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold;width:64px;height:64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636710038798_99018374.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold;width:64px;height:64px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">破防组合2：</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:700;\">木伞+甜甜圈+镰刀人偶</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(185,8,8);\">木伞需要点火6星</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:700;\">，</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(210,0,0);\">镰刀人偶等级越高越好</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:700;\">，低级效果很差，注意</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(196,1,1);\">把队长换为甜甜圈</span></div><div style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(201,0,0);font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">上述破防组合只选其中1组，不可混搭使用</span><br style=\"\"></span></div></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"狐狸专用对策小组\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn active\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">对策小组</div></div><br></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/57/2022/9/12/585805.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">吸血鬼</span>，血之诅咒让前排无压力抗伤害</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618227570_40376753.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 63px;\" data-width=\"252\" data-height=\"250\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/